---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const updated = "2026-07-11";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Valhouette Scribe"
  description="Privacy Policy for Valhouette Scribe. This site sets no tracking cookies and collects no personal data directly. All quizzes run entirely in your browser."
  noindex={false}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--content">
      <header class="page-header">
        <p class="page-eyebrow">Transparency</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
        <hr class="page-rule" />
      </header>

      <div class="legal-body">
        <h2>Overview</h2>

        <p>
          Valhouette Scribe exists to encourage reflection, not surveillance.
          Respecting your privacy is part of that philosophy.
        </p>

        <p>
          This website is intentionally simple. It does not collect personal
          information directly, does not use analytics to follow your behaviour,
          and does not track how you move through the site. Most pages are
          simply files delivered to your browser.
        </p>

        <p>
          The only exceptions are the services required to host the website and
          any optional third-party services that may be introduced in the
          future, such as advertising. Those are explained below.
        </p>

        <h2>What this site collects</h2>

        <p>
          Valhouette Scribe does not collect personal information directly.
          There are no user accounts, comment sections, contact forms,
          newsletters, or databases connected to this website.
        </p>

        <p>
          The essays are static pages, and the quizzes run entirely inside your
          browser. Your answers, scores, and results never leave your device.
        </p>

        <h2>Cloudflare (hosting)</h2>
        <p>
          This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may collect
          technical data including IP addresses, browser type, and request
          timestamps as part of their standard infrastructure and security
          operations. This data is held and processed by Cloudflare under their
          own privacy policy, available at cloudflare.com/privacypolicy.
          Valhouette Scribe does not have direct access to these logs.
        </p>

        <h2>Quizzes</h2>

        <p>
          Every quiz on this website runs entirely inside your browser. Nothing
          is uploaded. Nothing is stored. Nothing is sent to Valhouette Scribe.
        </p>

        <p>
          Your answers exist only on your own device for as long as the page
          remains open. Closing or refreshing the page removes them completely.
        </p>
        <h2>Google AdSense</h2>
        <p>
          This site may display advertising served by Google AdSense. If AdSense
          is active, Google may place cookies on your device and collect data
          about your browsing behaviour for the purposes of serving relevant
          advertising. You can review Google's privacy policy at
          policies.google.com/privacy. You can opt out of personalised
          advertising through your Google account settings or via your browser.
        </p>
        <p>
          If AdSense is not currently active on this site, no Google advertising
          cookies are in use.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          Valhouette Scribe does not place first-party tracking cookies on your
          device. If third-party services such as Cloudflare or Google AdSense
          use cookies, those are governed by their own privacy policies rather
          than this website.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          If you are located in the European Economic Area, you have rights
          under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), including the
          right to access, correct, or delete personal data held about you. If
          you are located in South Africa, you have rights under the Protection
          of Personal Information Act (POPIA).
        </p>
        <p>
          Because Valhouette Scribe does not collect personal data directly,
          most data subject requests should be directed to the relevant
          third-party processor. For hosting-related data, contact Cloudflare.
          For any other query, contact Valhouette Scribe at the address below.
        </p>

        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>
          This site may contain links to external websites. Valhouette Scribe is
          not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those sites.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          This policy may be updated from time to time. The date at the top of
          this page reflects the most recent revision. If this policy changes
          significantly, the updated version will always appear on this page
          together with its revision date.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
          If you have questions about privacy or this policy, you can contact
          Valhouette Scribe at
          <a href="mailto:contact@valhouettescribe.com">
            contact@valhouettescribe.com
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .page-header {
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .page-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .page-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .page-updated {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .page-rule {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-top: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .legal-body h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }

    .legal-body p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--body);
    }

    .legal-body a {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hover);
      padding-bottom: 1px;
    }
    .legal-body a:hover {
      border-bottom-color: var(--accent-warm);
      color: var(--heading);
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
